{"id":"n56607-1-4","stage":4,"title":"발돋움 · 踮脚","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56607-1-4-1","ko":"앞 사람들 때문에 앞이 하나도 안 보여.","zh":"因为前面的人，我完全看不见前面了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"앞","meaning":"前面","explanation":"앞：前面。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"7","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들","audio":"/audio/f97fd69abf0bb02978b9.mp3"}},{"text":"때문에","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"때문：因为，由于；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"때문","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64555","senseId":"1","lemma":"때문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때문에","audio":"/audio/870904a840bc33218066.mp3"}},{"text":"앞이","meaning":"前面","explanation":"앞：前面；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"7","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞이","audio":"/audio/c74b78ad5b87526d4712.mp3"}},{"text":"하나도","meaning":"完全","explanation":"하나：完全；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20283","senseId":"4","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나도","audio":"/audio/11c4172e3e9554b54380.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceRe